# Story 111: Chatbot Widget & Connections (45s)
# Hook: Drop a rysh-powered chatbot on your website with one script tag.
# Duration: 45s
# Source: story-111-chatbot-widget-connections.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 5

[00:00.0 --> 00:05.0]
Drop a rysh-powered chatbot on your website with one script tag.

[00:05.0 --> 00:15.0]
Each workspace has its own chatbot config -- a system prompt, a model, and a list of allowed origins that may embed it.

[00:15.0 --> 00:25.0]
You embed it with a single script -- chatbot slash widget dot js -- and the widget appears on your site.

[00:25.0 --> 00:35.0]
Every visitor gets their own session, and at any point a human can step in and take over the conversation from the bot.

[00:35.0 --> 00:45.0]
Beyond the website, the same workspace can connect external channels -- Slack, WhatsApp, Email -- so every conversation lands in one place.

